  "question": {
    "text": "A liquid drop having surface energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> is spread into&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>512</mn></math> droplets of same size. The final surface energy of the droplets is"
  },
  "options": [
